    "description": "<p>If you spend a Shift taming and training a non-hostile Beast with a HD count no higher than your Level, you can have it follow you as a companion. You command it with your Action or by skipping your Move. Otherwise, it instinctively attacks your Enemies. It uses your Survival for Checks. You can only have one companion at a time.</p>",
